            (CategoryTheory.Sheaf P.left.smallEtaleTopology AddCommGrpCat.{u})),
        SC.ShortExact →
        CategoryTheory.Limits.IsZero (weilEtaleHigherDirectImage π_fst b SC.X₁) →
