            hπ_inv, CategoryTheory.IsIso.hom_inv_id_assoc]
          exact (CategoryTheory.Category.comp_id _).symm
        · rw [← CategoryTheory.cancel_epi (δ' hSE' 0),
            ← CategoryTheory.Category.assoc, hπ_inv, CategoryTheory.Category.assoc,
